WEBVTT

00:32:57.288 --> 00:33:03.079
Yeah, yeah. I mean, it's it's it's hard to
it's hard to disagree with with those

00:33:03.204 --> 00:33:08.121
those observations. So a few things
that I want to make sure we cover.

00:33:08.538 --> 00:33:11.996
I wanted to do a slightly shorter
lightning round where we build

00:33:11.996 --> 00:33:14.121
a little color around maybe the size of

00:33:14.121 --> 00:33:15.996
a view that most people don't get to see.

00:33:17.371 --> 00:33:20.288
So the first question I had for
you on that is if you weren't

00:33:20.288 --> 00:33:23.496
a primatologist, what other jobs
might you have wanted?

00:33:25.621 --> 00:33:31.454
Well, anything to be out in nature
before that really crystallized,